<%- include("partials/head") %>
<%- include("partials/header") %>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Express 5 + TypeScript</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A production-grade 2026 scaffold: JWT authentication, MongoDB persistence,
    typed controllers, routes, services and middleware. Every API route is
    locked behind authentication - the EJS views are temporary, ready to be
    swapped for a Vite + React frontend.
  </p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn" href="/api-health" id="health-link">Check health</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cards">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Auth API</h2>
    <p>Sign up, sign in and password reset under <code>/auth</code>. Passwords are hashed with bcrypt, sessions use short-lived JWTs.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Protected JSON API</h2>
    <p>REST endpoints under <code>/tasks</code> (Bearer token required) with Zod validation and per-user scoping in MongoDB.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Env config</h2>
    <p><code>PORT</code>, <code>MONGODB_URI</code>, <code>JWT_SECRET</code> and <code>CORS_ORIGIN</code> are validated at boot with Zod.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>